---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../style.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="About - ResKitt">
    <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl py-12 px-6 md:px-12">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-black dark:text-slate-200">About ResKitt</h1>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium my-4">
            Your all-in-one resources kit for smarter learning.
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-2 dark:text-slate-50">What is Reskitt?</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400">
            ResKitt is short for Resources Kit - a free, all-in-one platform
            built for students, learners, and anyone who wants to stay organized
            and productive. Instead of jumping between multiple websites and
            apps, ResKitt brings everything you need into one clean, simple
            place.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-2 dark:text-slate-50">What We Offer</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400">
            Whether you're studying for exams, managing assignments, or just
            trying to stay on top of things, Reskitt has the tools for you:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400 list-disc ml-8 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2">
            <li>
                <a href="#" class="underline text-primary">GPA Calculator</a> - Track and calculate your grades with
                ease
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="#" class="underline text-primary">Word Counter</a> - Count words, characters, and
                more instantly
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="#" class="underline text-primary">Task Planner</a> - Plan your day and manage your to-do
                list
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="#" class="underline text-primary">Notes App</a> - Take and save notes anytime, anywhere
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="#" class="underline text-primary">Books & Resources</a> - Explore curated learning materials
            </li>
            <li>And more tools being added regularly!</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-2 dark:text-slate-50">Our Story</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400">
            We built Reskitt because we noticed a simple problem - students were
            wasting time switching between dozens of different websites just to
            get basic things done. We wanted to fix that. So we created one
            place where all the essential tools and resources live together,
            free to get started for everyone.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-2 dark:text-slate-50">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400">
            To make quality tools and learning resources accessible to every
            student and learner - simple to use and all in one place.
        </p>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
